{"id":"nikakoj","lemma":"никакой","pos":"pron","rank":515,"glosses":["not any of possible variants, no, none; (in a negative context) whatever, whatsoever, absolutely"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/00/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B9.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B9.ogg.mp3","forms":{"neuter":"никакое","feminine":"никакая","plural":"никакие"},"examples":[{"text":"Я никакой из них не хочу.","en":"I don't want either of them.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"from / out of"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"}]},{"text":"Мы были никакие.","en":"We were wasted.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"were","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Я не вижу здесь никакой проблемы.","en":"I don't see any problem here.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to see","l":"видеть"},{"g":"here"},null,{"g":"problem","l":"проблема"}]},{"text":"Мне никакая из них не нравится.","en":"I like neither of them.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"from / out of"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to like","l":"нравиться"}]},{"text":"Том уже, кажется, никакой.","en":"Tom seems pretty wasted already.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/196145","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"already"},{"g":"apparently, it seems"},null]}]}